@deptId = dea5c885-2549-425f-a7ef-8cf4e6799a52

### Lister les départements
GET {{host}}/api/v1/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Créer un département
POST {{host}}/api/v1/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Engineering" }

### Nom vide -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/v1/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "   " }

### Renommer
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/departments/{{deptId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Platform Engineering" }

### Supprimer
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/departments/{{deptId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

@employeeId = PASTE_AN_EMPLOYEE_ID_HERE

### Mon profil
GET {{host}}/api/v1/employees/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lister les employés (Manager)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Créer un employé
POST {{host}}/api/v1/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "keycloakSubjectId": "PASTE_KEYCLOAK_USER_ID", "firstName": "Bob", "lastName": "Martin", "departmentId": "{{deptId}}", "managerId": null }

### Désactiver
POST {{host}}/api/v1/employees/{{employeeId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}